 "equipment_type": "VRF / split AC gateway",
 "applies_to": "Intesis 700 Series Air Gateway IN770AIR***O000 with the Mitsubishi Electric City Multi application (M-NET centralised controllers (AE-200, EW-50, G-50 and others)), Modbus RTU / TCP server, user manual version 1.0.19 (2026-03-16).",
 "summary": "Intesis 700 Series gateway that reads Mitsubishi Electric City Multi groups through one or two centralised controllers and serves them as Modbus RTU / TCP. Each group gets a 100-register block with on/off, mode, fan, vane, setpoint (x10), room temperature, run hours, errors, panel permissions and setback / dual setpoints.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU",
  "TCP"
 ],
